{"id":"3015a5a145e2e498","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-closed-comprehension.md","title":"闭理解范畴","display":"df-closed-comprehension — 闭理解范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-closed-comprehension","aliases":["16-df-closed-comprehension","Closed comprehension","16-closed-comprehension"],"display":"df-closed-comprehension — 闭理解范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-full-comprehension]]","[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]","[[16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct]]"],"source":"Definition 10.5.3, p. 625 (PDF 645)","revision_date":"2026-10-20"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-closed-comprehension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-closed-comprehension</span><span>Closed comprehension</span><span>16-closed-comprehension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-closed-comprehension — 闭理解范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8f70563c9e9154ec\" href=\"?note=8f70563c9e9154ec\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-quantification\">16-df-comprehension-quantification</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"8325efaf9d443ca2\" href=\"?note=8325efaf9d443ca2\" title=\"16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct\">16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 10.5.3, p. 625 (PDF 645)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-20"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\">\\(p:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\">\\(\\chi:\\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal B^{\\to}\\)</span> 是候选理解结构。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>满理解、单位、依赖积、强依赖和分别采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"8f70563c9e9154ec\" href=\"?note=8f70563c9e9154ec\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-quantification\">16-df-comprehension-quantification</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8325efaf9d443ca2\" href=\"?note=8325efaf9d443ca2\" title=\"16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct\">16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\">\\(\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}\\)</span> 为本原子定义的记号，其结构参数与完整条件在下文给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompProd}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompProd}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"8f70563c9e9154ec\" href=\"?note=8f70563c9e9154ec\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-quantification\">16-df-comprehension-quantification</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompUnit}\">\\(\\mathrm{CompUnit}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" href=\"?note=7ef7c23f9a9f13d7\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-with-unit\">16-df-comprehension-with-unit</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FullComp}\">\\(\\mathrm{FullComp}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"dfea0d23e394e93b\" href=\"?note=dfea0d23e394e93b\" title=\"16-df-full-comprehension\">16-df-full-comprehension</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongCompCoprod}\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongCompCoprod}\\)</span> 的定义及结构参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"8325efaf9d443ca2\" href=\"?note=8325efaf9d443ca2\" title=\"16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct\">16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct</a>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}comprehension}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CompProd}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{StrongCompCoprod}(p,\\chi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,1))\\ h=h.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}closed\\text{-}comprehension}\\vdash\\quad \\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{ClosedCompr}(p,\\chi)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{FullComp}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{CompUnit}(p,\\chi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{CompProd}(p,\\chi)\\land\\mathrm{StrongCompCoprod}(p,\\chi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\forall I\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists!h\\in\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal B}(I,1))\\ h=h.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是 Definition 10.5.3 的 CCompC；它不把等式结构列为必要条件。</li>\n<li>参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi\">\\(\\chi\\)</span> 不可省略：closed comprehension 是理解范畴的结构性质。纤维 CCC 是推论，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"03e3216b8128fbcd\" href=\"?note=03e3216b8128fbcd\" title=\"16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc\">16-prop-closed-comprehension-fibred-ccc</a>。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Definition 10.5.3, p. 625 (PDF 645)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-full-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"dfea0d23e394e93b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-full-comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-with-unit","status":"resolved","id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-quantification","status":"resolved","id":"8f70563c9e9154ec","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct","status":"resolved","id":"8325efaf9d443ca2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-full-comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"dfea0d23e394e93b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"满理解、单位、依赖积、强依赖和分别采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]、[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]、[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]、[[16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-with-unit","status":"resolved","id":"7ef7c23f9a9f13d7","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"满理解、单位、依赖积、强依赖和分别采用 [[16-df-full-comprehension]]、[[16-df-comprehension-with-unit]]、[[16-df-comprehension-quantification]]、[[16-df-strong-dependent-coproduct]]。","embe